OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be cloudy with
OL,6,Foutbreaks of mostly light rain
OL,7,Fspreading northwards in the morning.
OL,8,FTurning drier through the afternoon
OL,9,Fbut still staying rather cloudy.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FIt will become increasingly
OL,12,Fdull and cloudy with some patchy light
OL,13,Frain in the evening. More persistent
OL,14,Fand heavier rain will spread north
OL,15,Fovernight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
