OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FCloudy with occasionally
OL,6,Fheavy rain spreading north in the
OL,7,Fmorning. Staying cloudy in the
OL,8,Fafternoon with further showery rain,
OL,9,Fpersistent in places and occasionally
OL,10,Fheavy with a chance of thunder.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,13,FUnsettled on Wednesday with showers or
OL,14,Flonger spells of rain, heavy at times.
OL,15,FRain clears Thursday morning, then
OL,16,Fdrier and brighter with a few showers.
OL,17,FBright start Friday, showers later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
